g a decision, promise, permission or completion claim. Return the supplied JSON schema only. Use the declared lexical names instead of internal entity IDs. Express a reported-request with 'You requested revision of A.' or 'The requested change is to revise A.' Express retain relations with 'P must remain able to V A.' or 'The change must keep P able to V A.' Coordinate multiple verbs with 'and'. Roles choice, inspection and recovery use verbs choose, inspect and restore respectively. Only when a completion relation is explicitly present, also say 'The revision of A is complete.' Account for every intended relation. Do not add politeness, advice or other clauses outside this finite experimental grammar. These are expression candidates, never authority. Copy request_id exactly." ((reported-request (path artifact revised))) ((named ledger artifact artifact)) candidate-available)))
